{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15926","headline":"求友 · 王建","name":"求友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鉴形须明镜，疗疾须良医。\n若无傍人见，形疾安自知。\n世路薄言行，学成弃其师。\n每怀一饭恩，不重劝勉词。\n斅学既不诚，朋友道日亏。\n遂作名利交，四海争奔驰。\n常慕正直人，生死不相离。\n苟能成我身，甘与僮仆随。\n我言彼当信，彼道我无疑。\n针药及病源，以石投深池。\n终朝举善道，敬爱当行之。\n纵令误所见，亦贵本相规。\n不求立名声，所贵去瑕玼。\n各愿贻子孙，永爲後世资。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15926.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15926","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}